WEBVTT

00:07.240 --> 00:10.990
<i>The students of the Misfit Class 
were given a task.</i>

00:11.360 --> 00:16.580
<i>If they do not all advance to the 
Dalet rank before their second year,</i>

00:16.580 --> 00:22.600
<i>they will be kicked out of the Royal One, 
which they worked so hard to acquire.</i>

00:22.600 --> 00:26.340
<i>Iruma and his friends must attempt 
the rank-advancement exams.</i>

00:26.660 --> 00:29.960
<i>First up... The Harvest Festival!</i>

02:06.010 --> 02:10.080
Well fought, my young demons!

02:10.080 --> 02:13.160
In celebration of the new Young King,

02:13.160 --> 02:17.140
I bestow upon you all a great reward!

02:18.650 --> 02:20.780
Behold!

02:20.780 --> 02:25.840
The flower never before seen 
in the demon world!

02:45.800 --> 02:47.430
Wh-What the...?

03:05.830 --> 03:06.840
That's devi huge!

03:06.840 --> 03:08.330
It's so devi pretty!

03:08.330 --> 03:10.300
Th-This is...

03:13.600 --> 03:15.710
Pretty! So pretty!

03:24.720 --> 03:26.480
Yis, yis.

03:26.480 --> 03:28.600
Nii-san, this is...

03:28.600 --> 03:31.230
Yeah... It's super pretty.

03:50.320 --> 03:52.650
It's so warm and...

03:52.650 --> 03:55.000
...fluffy. This is—

03:55.480 --> 03:57.920
<i>...something we've totally seen before.</i>

04:01.470 --> 04:03.760
Iruma-kun!

04:03.760 --> 04:05.640
Congrats on your victory!

04:05.640 --> 04:07.600
G-Grandpa?

04:07.600 --> 04:11.980
Your grandpa was watching!
 I was so moved!

04:11.980 --> 04:14.140
I was also quite moved.

04:14.140 --> 04:15.480
Opera-san!

04:17.890 --> 04:19.970
So this is the Legend Leaf.

04:19.970 --> 04:21.480
Y-Yes.

04:22.250 --> 04:25.160
Perhaps the one who created 
the Harvest Festival

04:25.160 --> 04:28.880
wanted everyone to see these flowers.

04:29.190 --> 04:32.320
Say, Grandpa. Aren't these flowers—

04:31.500 --> 04:32.320
Yes.

04:32.320 --> 04:34.630
What an amazing situation.

04:34.630 --> 04:35.290
Hello?

04:35.290 --> 04:37.450
My beloved students, 
who have finished fighting

04:37.450 --> 04:39.640
and have welcomed these 
beautiful flowers...

04:40.080 --> 04:42.720
All right, you two. Line up, line up.

04:42.720 --> 04:43.630
Huh?

04:52.980 --> 04:58.230
We're going to move right into the 
award ceremony and announce the rankings!

05:02.730 --> 05:04.320
All right...

05:04.640 --> 05:09.080
We will now begin the Harvest 
Festival award ceremony!

05:11.160 --> 05:12.830
Go, Chairdemon!

05:12.830 --> 05:14.330
So cool!

05:15.450 --> 05:17.080
The winners...

05:17.650 --> 05:20.840
Iruma and Shax Lead, come forward!

05:26.590 --> 05:28.100
Iruma-sama!

05:26.590 --> 05:28.100
Iruma-chi!

05:28.100 --> 05:30.780
They are the pride of 
the whole Misfit Class!

05:30.780 --> 05:32.100
Yes.

05:39.980 --> 05:42.480
Orobas              Coco

05:42.720 --> 05:46.790
During this Harvest Festival, 
you have displayed an unbreakable spirit,

05:46.790 --> 05:51.990
and unbelievable determination, 
and brilliantly won 120,000 points.

05:51.990 --> 05:56.480
Making the Legend Leaf bloom 
is a glorious feat!

05:56.480 --> 05:58.240
And considering all of those things...

06:05.120 --> 06:07.980
Iruma and Lead, I will now...

06:09.000 --> 06:12.400
raise both of your ranks to Dalet.

06:18.730 --> 06:20.000
We're Dalet!

06:21.020 --> 06:24.480
You're amazing, Iruma-san!

06:22.930 --> 06:24.480
Dalet?

06:24.480 --> 06:25.990
The Young Kings...

06:25.990 --> 06:27.960
I like the look in their eyes.

06:29.490 --> 06:30.750
Iruma-sama...

06:30.750 --> 06:33.240
Iruma-chi, congrats!

06:33.240 --> 06:34.760
Way to go, Lead!

06:34.760 --> 06:35.990
Congratulations!

06:35.990 --> 06:38.370
Two new Young Kings are born!

06:38.370 --> 06:40.490
Congratulations.

06:42.260 --> 06:43.860
Iruma...

06:43.860 --> 06:45.880
Isn't this great, President?

06:45.880 --> 06:46.920
Yes.

06:47.540 --> 06:50.190
Not because Iruma became the Young King!

06:50.190 --> 06:56.010
I just mean it's great that the Harvest 
Festival ended safely again this year. Yes!

06:54.260 --> 06:56.010
Yes, I know.

06:56.020 --> 06:57.600
Yes, yes.

06:57.600 --> 07:00.380
I'm so proud of you, my students.

07:00.380 --> 07:02.710
Oh, my mic...

07:01.250 --> 07:02.710
Silence.

07:02.710 --> 07:04.480


07:03.260 --> 07:07.550
Next, we will announce 
the highest-ranked students.

07:07.550 --> 07:09.650
First up, in third place...

07:08.500 --> 07:09.640


07:10.110 --> 07:11.610
Orobas Coco.

07:14.400 --> 07:16.530
You have been promoted to Gimmel.

07:16.530 --> 07:17.160
He's Gimmel!

07:17.160 --> 07:19.660
Congrats on third place!

07:17.160 --> 07:19.670
Way to go, Orobas!

07:29.120 --> 07:31.570
I have something to ask you later.

07:32.270 --> 07:33.780
Got it?

07:33.780 --> 07:35.010
Yes, sir.

07:35.010 --> 07:37.110
You're devi awesome, Orobas.

07:37.110 --> 07:38.320
You're Gimmel!

07:38.320 --> 07:40.410
Now you're gonna be a three guy.

07:40.410 --> 07:41.970
No, I'm not.

07:41.970 --> 07:43.680
Next...

07:43.680 --> 07:46.740
He's probably knocked out 
and won't hear this, but...

07:47.520 --> 07:49.960
In fourth place, Sabnock Sabro.

07:49.960 --> 07:52.730
He has been promoted 
from Rank Bet to Rank Gimmel.

07:52.730 --> 07:55.030
I hate to acknowledge the guy, but I will.

07:55.030 --> 07:57.030
Even if he's an idiot. Right? Right?

07:57.030 --> 07:59.740
He is pretty impressive. 
Even if he's an idiot.

07:59.740 --> 08:04.440
Asmodeus had to forfeit, 
so he will not be promoted.

08:04.440 --> 08:07.300
Technically, he could 
probably be at Rank He,

08:07.300 --> 08:10.120
but he seems pretty satisfied where he is.

08:10.120 --> 08:14.640
Iruma-sama is Rank Dalet! 
Just like me! We're a pair!

08:14.640 --> 08:17.550
Mrr. No fair, Azz-Azz!

08:17.550 --> 08:20.210
If you're mad about it, 
you can become Dalet yourself.

08:20.210 --> 08:22.400
I will! I'll do just that!

08:22.610 --> 08:24.630
In fifth place, the Dorodoro Brothers.

08:25.760 --> 08:28.940
You've been promoted 
from Rank Alef to Rank Gimmel.

08:28.940 --> 08:31.320
Three?! We're not one anymore?!

08:31.320 --> 08:34.670
Nii-san, we don't need to be one here.

08:34.670 --> 08:35.650
Really?!

08:38.990 --> 08:40.040
Next up...

08:40.300 --> 08:44.180
Next up, we'll be honoring 
those who showed great work

08:44.180 --> 08:47.330
and earned points during 
the Harvest Festival.

08:48.560 --> 08:51.980
First up, Agares Picero and Garp Goemon.

08:53.480 --> 08:56.630
They established a powerful 
stronghold during the Harvest Festival

08:56.630 --> 08:59.020
and saved a number of other students.

09:00.460 --> 09:02.120
Because of their hard work,

09:02.120 --> 09:06.720
we had the least amount of students forfeit 
compared to all the festivals before.

09:06.720 --> 09:08.200
With that in mind,

09:08.200 --> 09:11.530
both of them will be promoted 
to Rank Gimmel.

09:11.530 --> 09:13.490
We did it!

09:14.110 --> 09:15.370
Yay!

09:15.370 --> 09:16.870
This is devi!

09:16.870 --> 09:18.030
You did it!

09:18.030 --> 09:19.700
Congrats!

09:19.700 --> 09:23.490
And now, a congratulatory kiss.

09:24.200 --> 09:25.920
Congratulations, my lord!

09:27.460 --> 09:30.250
Hey! Get off me! It's hot!

09:30.250 --> 09:32.860
Oh, but youth is always passionate and hot.

09:34.790 --> 09:37.880
Next up, let's honor competitiveness.

09:38.320 --> 09:39.470
Queen!

09:43.600 --> 09:46.670
She managed to take the magical beasts 
under her command and establish a kingdom.

09:46.670 --> 09:48.540
This has never been seen before.

09:48.540 --> 09:53.110
Their charisma and control 
was something to behold.

09:53.110 --> 09:59.160
Therefore, we will be promoting Crocell 
Keroli and Caim Camuy to Rank Gimmel.

09:59.160 --> 10:00.000
Gi...

10:00.000 --> 10:01.260
Gimmel!

10:01.260 --> 10:03.490
Congratulations!

10:06.250 --> 10:08.130
Screaming from the forest?

10:08.130 --> 10:10.890
Kerolin, congrats!

10:10.890 --> 10:12.500
Th-Thanks...

10:12.500 --> 10:15.130
My Queen, congratulations.

10:17.010 --> 10:18.250
Yis.

10:18.250 --> 10:23.850
Elizabetta X fought alongside them 
and showed her true potential as well.

10:23.850 --> 10:26.390
She will be promoted to Rank Bet.

10:26.390 --> 10:27.140
Oh, my!

10:27.140 --> 10:29.400
Congrats, Sis!

10:29.400 --> 10:32.870
Those are the eleven 
who have been promoted.

10:32.870 --> 10:37.400
Let us applaud all of their hard work!

10:37.400 --> 10:39.610
Well done, everyone!

10:50.870 --> 10:58.830
<i>You ran through and made it this far</i>

10:58.830 --> 11:06.090
<i>Even if we're out of breath, 
covered in mud, and can't go on</i>

11:06.090 --> 11:11.510
<i>No one will blame us for it</i>

11:11.510 --> 11:20.210
<i>Even then, you were 
able to stand at the top</i>

11:20.210 --> 11:28.720
<i>What reflects upon your eyes right now?</i>

11:28.720 --> 11:37.440
<i>I want to be by your side 
and see the same sights as you</i>

11:37.440 --> 11:42.000
<i>Congratulations, congratulations</i>

11:42.000 --> 11:50.480
<i>Rest your wings next to me, 
at least for tonight</i>

11:50.480 --> 11:54.860
<i>Once you wake, you'll fly off again</i>

11:54.860 --> 12:01.190
<i>I will keep following you forever</i>

12:01.190 --> 12:09.750
<i>The cherry blossoms dance so pure</i>

12:09.750 --> 12:13.870
<b><i>No 
promotion</i></b>

12:09.750 --> 12:13.870
<b><i>Forfeit</i></b>

12:09.750 --> 12:13.870
<b><i>LOL!!</i></b>

12:09.750 --> 12:19.780
<i>Congratulations, congratulations</i>

12:22.880 --> 12:26.120
Hey, what the heck? 
Where'd Robin-sensei go?

12:26.680 --> 12:28.510
And Master Bachiko, too.

12:28.510 --> 12:33.180
Uh, hello?! Your pupil won here!

12:33.180 --> 12:34.640
Robin-sensei!

12:34.640 --> 12:36.640
Your precious pupil—

12:37.910 --> 12:40.080
Whoa! M-Master?

12:39.280 --> 12:41.520
Hey.

12:41.520 --> 12:44.200
Iruma, you bastard. You jerk.

12:44.200 --> 12:46.130
What the hell were you 
thinking on the first day?

12:46.130 --> 12:49.090
Why would you eat all your points?!

12:49.090 --> 12:50.460
Um, uh...

12:50.460 --> 12:54.580
I told you to think! How dare 
you ignore all my advice!

12:54.580 --> 12:55.960
Er, I didn't ignore all of—

12:55.960 --> 12:58.460
Seriously, you're such...

12:59.720 --> 13:01.800
a dumb student.

13:04.720 --> 13:07.400
Great job, Iruma!

13:11.300 --> 13:12.520
Thanks!

13:15.320 --> 13:17.870
Iruma, where's your crown?

13:17.870 --> 13:20.240
Oh, Lead-kun took it.

13:20.240 --> 13:21.620
Well, get it back!

13:21.620 --> 13:23.240
Y-Yes, ma'am!

13:23.240 --> 13:24.170
Come on, let's go!

13:23.580 --> 13:25.320
<i>Suzuki Iruma, age fourteen.</i>

13:24.170 --> 13:26.290
Right, right, right, right!

13:25.580 --> 13:29.880
<i>Winner of the Harvest Festival, 
 promoted to Rank Dalet.</i>

13:26.290 --> 13:28.300
That way, that way! Left, left, left!

13:28.300 --> 13:30.980
W-W-Wait! M-Master!

13:31.700 --> 13:36.620
<b>I'm gonna 
win for
 sure!</b>

13:38.880 --> 13:42.640
<i>The four days of the Harvest 
Festival are finally over.</i>

13:43.040 --> 13:46.510
<i>That night, the first-years 
were gathered into a hall...</i>

13:46.510 --> 13:47.720
<b>Harvest Festival Afterparty</b>

13:46.750 --> 13:49.960
All right, everyone. 
It's time for an afterparty!

13:50.010 --> 13:52.470
<b>Harvest Festival Afterparty</b>

13:50.010 --> 13:52.470
<b>m 0 0 l 175 0 175 30 0 30</b>

13:53.190 --> 13:54.980
<i>Anything goes at the afterparty.</i>

13:55.210 --> 14:01.470
<i>Everyone is here to have a good time
and commend each other on a job well-done.</i>

14:01.800 --> 14:03.960
This is Balam-sensei.

14:03.960 --> 14:05.980
He is my master, as well 
as the honor student's.

14:06.570 --> 14:08.610
Oh, hello.

14:13.500 --> 14:17.320
<i>These two had the wrong master in mind.</i>

14:21.710 --> 14:23.780
What's up, third guy?

14:23.780 --> 14:26.120
I'd prefer if you didn't call me that.

14:26.120 --> 14:27.530
Er, well...

14:27.530 --> 14:33.210
I can't shake the feeling that I was working 
with someone during the Harvest Festival.

14:33.210 --> 14:36.320
Kalego-sensei asked me about it, as well,

14:36.320 --> 14:38.720
but my memory seems to be quite fuzzy.

14:38.720 --> 14:39.970
Were you?

14:39.970 --> 14:43.880
When I was watching the broadcast, 
it looked like you were off on your own.

14:43.880 --> 14:45.230
Really?

14:45.230 --> 14:47.790
More importantly, this is really good.

14:47.790 --> 14:48.620
Have some.

14:48.620 --> 14:49.710
Uh...

14:54.160 --> 14:57.410
Let the Broadcasting 
Battler interview you later.

14:57.410 --> 15:00.790
Let me know how it feels to be 
the third guy now. See ya.

15:00.790 --> 15:02.810
Again, could you not—

15:04.300 --> 15:06.660
I'm leaving the rest up to you.

15:06.660 --> 15:07.960
Of course.

15:09.530 --> 15:11.890
<i>I'd like to congratulate Iruma,</i>

15:11.890 --> 15:16.190
<i>but the first-years are the stars today, 
so I'll choose another time.</i>

15:16.600 --> 15:17.760
<i>I know...</i>

15:17.760 --> 15:20.560
<i>I'll get him something 
to congratulate him.</i>

15:20.560 --> 15:21.930
Come on! Bring out more stuff!

15:22.420 --> 15:24.110
Whoa, there's a lot of demons.

15:24.110 --> 15:26.440
Look over there! 
It's this year's Young Kings!

15:26.670 --> 15:30.350
Oh, they're this year's 
Young Kings, Iruma and Lead!

15:33.850 --> 15:35.410
Uh... which two are the Young Kings?

15:35.410 --> 15:36.960
There seem to be four of them...

15:36.960 --> 15:42.000
Uh, Iruma-kun... what's with this lineup?

15:43.460 --> 15:44.710
Well, you see...

15:44.710 --> 15:47.260
After the deadly battle 
of the Harvest Festival,

15:47.260 --> 15:51.560
I reaffirmed where I truly belong, and...

15:53.820 --> 15:56.820
I just can't let them go!

15:56.820 --> 15:58.310
What are you, a lonely baby?

15:58.310 --> 16:00.680
You're like the exact opposite 
of how you were during your evil cycle...

16:00.680 --> 16:04.240
You will have to go through us to seek an 
audience with the Young King Iruma-sama.

16:04.240 --> 16:05.600
Bow down!

16:05.600 --> 16:07.350
And these two are way too into their roles.

16:07.350 --> 16:08.430
Yeah!

16:08.430 --> 16:10.950
I'm a Young King, too, you know?

16:10.950 --> 16:11.580
Huh?

16:11.580 --> 16:13.200
Uh, don't get mad!

16:13.200 --> 16:14.200
Ow.

16:14.200 --> 16:18.710
You lack dignity, my friend. 
What's with this hairdo?

16:15.120 --> 16:18.710
Jazzy! Stop that!

16:18.700 --> 16:21.440
Weren't you talking 
with the Dorodoro Brothers?

16:18.710 --> 16:24.600
I'm the Young King! 
Bow down, dang it! Stop that!

16:21.440 --> 16:24.590
Well, I was, but...

16:24.590 --> 16:27.690
So you're the master's real students?!

16:27.690 --> 16:30.000
Isn't our master awesome?!

16:30.000 --> 16:31.510
He is, isn't he?

16:31.920 --> 16:33.720
Uh, I have no clue what 
you're talking about.

16:33.720 --> 16:35.430
Inconceivable.

16:35.430 --> 16:38.320
We had nothing in common at all.

16:38.320 --> 16:39.560
Why, though?

16:40.320 --> 16:43.680
Those brothers came to me yet again.

16:44.440 --> 16:47.440
Then they went to find Sergeant Furfur.

16:47.810 --> 16:51.810
I used that opportunity 
to lose Master Balam.

16:49.120 --> 16:54.820
Nag, nag, nag, nag, nag, nag, nag...

16:51.810 --> 16:53.160
<i>His lectures are so long...</i>

16:53.160 --> 16:54.820
I-I see...

16:54.820 --> 16:56.800
I picked this one up along the way, too.

16:56.800 --> 16:57.680
Huh?!

16:57.680 --> 16:59.700
She won't leave my side.

16:59.700 --> 17:01.140
What the heck, Queen?!

17:01.140 --> 17:03.330
Hey, don't shout like that.

17:03.330 --> 17:05.290
Queen!

17:05.290 --> 17:06.160
Queen!

17:06.160 --> 17:08.710
Queen! We'd like to enter your country!

17:08.710 --> 17:15.050
Queen! Queen! Queen! Queen! Queen! Queen!

17:10.560 --> 17:12.470
Stop calling me Queen!

17:12.760 --> 17:15.060
I mean, I did make a kingdom, but...

17:15.060 --> 17:18.480
When I stop to think about it, 
it's just so embarrassing!

17:19.970 --> 17:22.110
Ah, she returned to her senses.

17:22.110 --> 17:25.390
Queen! Queen! Queen! Queen!

17:23.970 --> 17:27.980
I mean right now, Nee-san 
seems way more like a queen.

17:27.980 --> 17:30.530
Oh, my. My, my.

17:30.530 --> 17:32.230
Whoa, that's amazing!

17:32.230 --> 17:33.980
Yeah, and then...

17:33.980 --> 17:35.530
Hey, are you listening, my lord?

17:35.530 --> 17:38.170
Just let me sleep already.

17:38.170 --> 17:40.610
Hey! There's Crocell!

17:39.030 --> 17:40.620
<b>Harvest Festival Afterparty</b>

17:40.930 --> 17:42.780
I'm gonna complain!

17:42.780 --> 17:44.250
See you later.

17:44.250 --> 17:46.620
Okay! Have a good time!

17:49.510 --> 17:52.390
Ah, he's leaving...

17:52.390 --> 17:59.140
But your ship will eventually 
return to my harbor.

18:00.260 --> 18:02.010
Mission complete!

18:02.010 --> 18:04.540
I see. I'll listen to your report later.

18:04.540 --> 18:06.080
No, no, no.

18:06.080 --> 18:08.070
Do you realize how much trouble that was?

18:08.070 --> 18:10.570
The forest's so deep 
that finding their presence was...

18:10.570 --> 18:13.020
I'll hear you out later.

18:11.680 --> 18:13.020
Whoopsie.

18:13.020 --> 18:14.460
Did you find them?

18:14.460 --> 18:15.300
Yeah.

18:15.300 --> 18:18.300
Thanks to you narrowing 
our search radius.

18:18.640 --> 18:21.010
Orobas didn't remember anything.

18:21.380 --> 18:23.780
He probably had his memories wiped.

18:23.780 --> 18:24.920
More importantly...

18:25.820 --> 18:29.160
Aren't they satisfied 
if they don't make all that racket?

18:29.160 --> 18:32.760
They're so full of energy. 
Oh, there's Sabro-kun.

18:32.760 --> 18:35.780
You're not going to shout
 "Silence!" at them today?

18:37.000 --> 18:44.450
They didn't hold back and showed their 
full potential from their training.

18:48.700 --> 18:50.340
They get a passing grade.

18:50.340 --> 18:52.580
Therefore, they're allowed 
to have a little fun.

18:52.580 --> 18:54.190
You're so strict.

18:54.190 --> 18:56.320
Why don't you tell them in person?

18:57.440 --> 18:59.120
They'll just let it go to their heads.

18:59.120 --> 19:02.410
There's plenty to lecture them on as well.

19:02.410 --> 19:06.370
After this, they'll have plenty 
to reflect on and...

19:11.750 --> 19:13.960
Ooh, there he is!

19:12.450 --> 19:15.280
Fluffyego-sensei.

19:13.960 --> 19:15.390
Splendid work, Iruma-sama.

19:15.390 --> 19:17.020
I haven't seen that in a while.

19:17.020 --> 19:17.760
This is rare.

19:17.760 --> 19:19.000
So fluffy...

19:19.000 --> 19:20.760
Now he's brethren.

19:20.760 --> 19:21.880
Iruma!

19:21.880 --> 19:23.870
I-I'm sorry!

19:23.870 --> 19:26.390
But they all said they wanted to see you.

19:26.660 --> 19:27.740
I couldn't refuse!

19:27.560 --> 19:30.140
<b>*Iruma can't say no to requests</b>

19:27.740 --> 19:29.660
Well, learn to say no, you fool!

19:31.760 --> 19:33.620
They look like they're having fun.

19:31.780 --> 19:33.620
The Misfit Class!

19:33.620 --> 19:35.270
They're causing a fuss again.

19:35.270 --> 19:35.910
Yeah...

19:35.830 --> 19:40.200
Y-You little...!

19:36.560 --> 19:40.940
It sure is always lively around Iruma-kun.

19:42.920 --> 19:50.830
You stupid troublemakers!

19:52.320 --> 19:53.310
Iruma-chi!

19:53.310 --> 19:55.200
Send me a message if you get lonely!

19:55.200 --> 19:56.420
Iruma-sama!

19:56.420 --> 20:00.030
You can call me or message me 
at any time or any place!

20:00.030 --> 20:01.600
Sure! Thanks.

20:01.600 --> 20:03.920
You two get plenty of rest.

20:03.920 --> 20:06.080
Well, goodnight!

20:08.190 --> 20:09.830
Now, then. Let us head home.

20:09.830 --> 20:11.840
Yes. Yes, indeed.

20:11.840 --> 20:15.070
Nee-chan! Welcome back!

20:15.320 --> 20:17.810
David, thank you for coming to get me.

20:17.810 --> 20:19.640
Welcome back.

20:20.070 --> 20:22.210
Mommy! Konchie! Keebow!

20:22.210 --> 20:24.040
Good work out there.

20:24.040 --> 20:27.280
Sin-Sin! Ran-Ran! It's been 
four berry berry berry long days.

20:27.280 --> 20:28.700
I missed you!

20:28.700 --> 20:31.200
Welcome back, Clara.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.420
Okay, let's head home.

20:32.420 --> 20:33.940
We've got a huge feast waiting!

20:33.940 --> 20:34.820
Norimaki!

20:34.210 --> 20:34.460
<b>Ma</b>

20:34.820 --> 20:36.080
Maguro sashimi!

20:34.960 --> 20:35.210
<b>Ma</b>

20:36.080 --> 20:37.950
Even Macadamia nuts!

20:36.210 --> 20:36.460
<b>Ma</b>

20:37.950 --> 20:39.130
Yay! Yay!

20:39.130 --> 20:40.290
Shh.

20:40.290 --> 20:42.600
Yay, yay, yay...

20:42.600 --> 20:45.600
Man, that was so much fun.

20:45.600 --> 20:47.790
I got to talk to everyone so much,

20:47.790 --> 20:51.600
though it ended up like 
it usually does in the end.

20:52.710 --> 20:54.600
Like it usually does...

20:54.600 --> 20:56.860
Like it usually does, huh?

21:04.480 --> 21:07.740
You're going to get cold 
if you stand there like that.

21:08.600 --> 21:10.620
Did you have fun at the afterparty?

21:10.620 --> 21:12.120
Yes! Very much so!

21:12.120 --> 21:14.000
That's good to hear.

21:16.250 --> 21:19.530
It's only been four days, 
but it feels like it's been forever!

21:19.530 --> 21:21.380
We were also getting ready for a par—

21:21.380 --> 21:23.380
Iruma-kun!

21:24.370 --> 21:26.970
We've been waiting for you! 
There's so much food!

21:26.970 --> 21:31.050
I did all the decorations! 
They're so sparkly!

21:31.050 --> 21:32.570
And, and...

21:32.570 --> 21:34.050
Sullivan-sama.

21:34.400 --> 21:35.930
Oh, right.

21:36.750 --> 21:39.190
There's a lot I'd like 
to talk to you about...

21:39.190 --> 21:41.500
But first, we need to say this first.

21:46.380 --> 21:47.910
The Harvest Festival...

21:47.910 --> 21:50.450
Well done all four days.

21:54.250 --> 21:56.470
Welcome back, Iruma-kun.

21:59.960 --> 22:02.600
Yeah! I'm home!

22:02.750 --> 22:10.970
<b>Welcome Back</b>

23:41.750 --> 23:44.270
Congratulations, Su-ki-ma!

23:42.020 --> 23:45.190
<b>Su</b>

23:42.770 --> 23:45.190
<b>Ki</b>

23:43.520 --> 23:45.190
<b>Ma</b>

24:03.000 --> 24:27.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:03.240 --> 24:06.840
Many unexpected things happened 
during this Harvest Festival.

24:06.840 --> 24:09.400
The biggest being the fact 
that Iruma and Lead won.

24:09.400 --> 24:11.320
Why are you looking 
at me like that, Shichiro?

24:11.320 --> 24:15.800
I didn't think for a second 
that they were going to win.

24:15.800 --> 24:17.880
That's why I'm not happy, either.

24:17.880 --> 24:19.800
Next time on <i>Welcome 
to Demon School! Iruma-kun</i>,

24:19.800 --> 24:21.100
"The Instructors' Banquet"

24:21.520 --> 24:22.860
An afterparty?

24:22.860 --> 24:27.980
First, we need to take care of the man 
who was taking advantage of Orobas Coco.
